& [AuthorityProjectionPack: IR2AuthorityProjectionPackV1] is the accepted boundary pack exported by IR2 after completion review acceptance
  + [pack_id] is ir2-authority-projection-pack-v1
  + [pack_uuid] is cf0c6b08-ed31-4d1e-b28c-2fe4b890a0d8
  + [source_chunk] is IR2 authority-file parser and SQLite projection builder
  + [export_status] is accepted_boundary_input_after_IR2_completion_review
  + [consumer_work] is IR2 bounded parser/projection implementation activation and downstream IR3 planning intake
  + [activation_effect] is IR2 bounded implementation activation may be planned from accepted contracts, file inventory, and fixture plan
  + [implementation_effect] is no parser code, SQLite projection code, fixture source files, expected ledgers, generated database files, dependencies, operations control, or live machine control is authorized by this pack alone

  = must: preserve SOP files as source authority and SQLite, parser caches, generated indexes, reports, and fixture outputs as projection-only
  = must: require explicit bounded implementation activation before creating or editing IR2 implementation files
  = must: require completion review after any future implementation slice before its output becomes accepted
  - never: treat this pack as permission to control processes, GPUs, model runtimes, jobs, credentials, networks, destructive filesystem actions, or live machines

